WEBVTT

00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:14,850
But using the Atelier Robin down for many months, do you still think it's the best machine on the market?

00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:18,130
My brother wants to get a Rife machine.

00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:25,730
With your recall, we have switched to mainly recommending the Atelier Robin machine over the true Rife.

00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:31,010
Back since last September, October when it came out.

00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:38,770
Yes, there was some bumps along the road to begin with, but now we haven't had any issues with them at all.

00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,370
Do I think it's a better machine?

00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:46,370
Yes, because it does put out three times the voltage.

00:00:48,210 --> 00:00:53,410
Do I think that it is the better machine because you can run

00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:58,130
harmonics on it? To me, that's the best piece of it.

00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:05,090
Also, you can run higher frequencies where you had to use the foot bath with the true Rife to get

00:01:05,090 --> 00:01:10,210
the higher frequencies. The Atelier Robin lets you get up to the higher frequencies

00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:17,650
that Royal Rife actually used. So, it has those three advantages.

00:01:17,650 --> 00:01:23,250
The disadvantage, though I would say, is that it is larger. It's bulkier.

00:01:24,690 --> 00:01:29,810
Patrick Robin may be working on changing that and redoing it just for us.

00:01:30,770 --> 00:01:37,970
I've given him my request of how to reform the machine in different ways and things that we don't

00:01:37,970 --> 00:01:44,450
need and things that I think will be better and improvements, and he may be making those changes

00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:51,810
in the next full-out. So, if a person, we don't always recommend the Atelier Robin. So, we've had

00:01:51,810 --> 00:01:58,210
people that you don't want it to write because they have a history of it to write. And that's okay,

00:01:58,210 --> 00:02:02,930
I still, because I think the trip's still great machine. And then, or we've had people that,

00:02:02,930 --> 00:02:11,170
hey, I travel a lot and I'm on the road all the time, then getting it to write makes a little bit

00:02:11,170 --> 00:02:18,210
more sense because it's much smaller, easier to travel with, easier to put, to wrap in a couple

00:02:18,210 --> 00:02:23,890
sweatshirts that put in a suitcase to keep it safe. And then it is the Atelier Robin. So,

00:02:23,970 --> 00:02:31,490
there's pros and cons to each unit as far as having it at home and using it at home, using it overnight.

00:02:31,490 --> 00:02:36,610
I think the Atelier Robin is the best machine. We have a number of people have both. They may have

00:02:36,610 --> 00:02:41,650
started out with the trip and they added the Atelier Robin with the, you know, use one at night to

00:02:41,650 --> 00:02:47,490
use one during the day so they have it in two different rooms. And so, that makes sense to, of course,

00:02:47,490 --> 00:02:52,130
there's cost to it. So, I understand that that's how it was doable for everybody. But

00:02:53,730 --> 00:03:00,930
if a person is calling and says, I just want to get the best one for me, it depends, again, partly depends

00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:09,730
on, you know, what their personal conditions are. So, you know, if they just want one for home to use

00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:14,210
if, you know, the kids got the flu or something like that, I think the Atelier Robin is much better

00:03:14,210 --> 00:03:19,250
because if you're really using it, mainly to kill pathogens, being dealing with the

00:03:19,250 --> 00:03:24,290
bone, you're dealing with bronchitis or dealing with tooth infections or dealing with ear infections

00:03:24,290 --> 00:03:29,890
or something like that, running 11th harmonics is better and I wrote all the programs at the Atelier

00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:37,170
Robin. Atelier Robin, I did not write all the programs of the true right. So, I had complete control

00:03:37,650 --> 00:03:46,130
of all the programs and all the frequencies. So, those are our programs. So, I feel much more comfortable

00:03:46,130 --> 00:03:55,170
and I feel much more comfortable with that. So, I feel much more comfortable with that. I feel much more comfortable with that.

